      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Kahneman's Prospect Theory in the Room</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Losses are felt harder than equivalent gains</text><rect x=\"120\" y=\"220\" width=\"860\" height=\"240\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"#888\" opacity=\"0.15\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"270\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#888\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\">Gain Frame</text><text x=\"160\" y=\"312\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"start\">“You'll save money if you renew.”</text><text x=\"160\" y=\"354\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"start\">Feels like a nice-to-have bonus</text><rect x=\"120\" y=\"500\" width=\"860\" height=\"240\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"#ef4444\" opacity=\"0.15\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"550\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\">Loss Frame</text><text x=\"160\" y=\"592\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"start\">“You'll lose your current rate by Friday.”</text><text x=\"160\" y=\"634\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"start\">Feels like an urgent threat to avoid</text><rect x=\"140\" y=\"780\" width=\"820\" height=\"100\" rx=\"50\" fill=\"#ffd700\" opacity=\"0.15\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"838\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">The brain weighs a loss roughly twice as heavily as an equal gain</text></svg></svg>",
      "caption": "The same math, weighted differently by the mind"
